---
/**
 * Addressable scan entry point — no UI of its own.
 *
 * The scan flow lives entirely in ReceiptScanSheet (mounted by BudgetShell).
 * This route survives only so old links keep working — drawer/FAB no-JS
 * fallbacks, email links — and forwards them to the transactions page, where
 * ?scan=1 asks the sheet to open the picker on arrival. Browsers that refuse
 * a picker without a gesture land on a page whose header has the camera
 * button, so the flow degrades to one more tap instead of a dead end.
 *
 * Rendering a standalone page here again would resurrect the duplicate
 * "scan screen" this redirect removed — don't.
 */
return Astro.redirect("/budget/transactions?scan=1");
---
